{
  "slug": "author-automations-social",
  "name": "Author Automations Social",
  "type": "plugin",
  "description": "Create and schedule social media posts, run AI campaigns, and manage your Author Automations Social account from Claude Code or Claude Cowork. Supports 13 platforms including Instagram, TikTok, Facebook, LinkedIn, and more.",
  "longDescription": "Ships **21 skills** and **2 commands**.\n\n- **Skills** (21): `aa-setup` (Use when the user wants to set up, configure, or connect Author Automations Social), `boost-post` (Use when the user wants to promote (boost) an already-published post with paid spend), `calendar-notes` (Use when the user wants to add an annotation, reminder, or milestone marker to a date on their…), `comment-to-dm-automation` (Use when the user wants Facebook or Instagram to automatically DM people who comment specific keywords on their…), `create-meta-ad` (Use when the user wants to build a fresh Facebook or Instagram ad from scratch — not promoting…), `find-something-to-post` (Use when the user wants ideas for content to post about — from their books, blog, or recent…), `guides-author` (Use when the user wants to create, view, edit, or delete a content guide or persona), `inbox-triage` (Use when the user wants to read or respond to incoming social activity — DMs, comments on their…), and 13 more\n- **Commands** (2): `aa-campaign` (Start an AI-powered social media campaign), `aa-post` (Create a social media post quickly)\n\nInstalls with `claude plugin install author-automations-social@claude-community` from `chellehoniker/claude-code-author-automations`.",
  "compatibility": [
    "claude"
  ],
